            <ArticleTitle>Seldom found acute abdomen: perforated diverticulum in the transverse colon.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>43-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a recently examined rare case of isolated perforated diverticulum of the transverse colon. At surgery, a perforated omentum-sealed diverticulum was found in the third distal wall of the transverse colon. A diverticulectomy was performed. The postoperative course was excellent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
